  <h2 style="margin-top:0">Matthias Ramahi</h2>
  <p><strong>Publisher and editor.</strong> Matthias Ramahi owns and maintains Auspicious Music and is responsible for its current editorial work. His public professional work spans photography, web production and SEO; on this site, the byline means he is accountable for the research, structure and wording of the page.</p>
  <p>It does not silently claim a conservatory qualification, an acoustic-engineering degree or first-hand use of every product mentioned. Technical pages state whether they are based on primary documentation, a reproducible procedure or a completed test.</p>
