  <h2>Specialist input</h2>
  <p>A linked specialist is not automatically a co-author or reviewer. When a future article includes an interview, performance note or technical review from another person, that contribution will be named on the page and agreed with that person before publication.</p>

  <h2>Corrections</h2>
  <p>Send a page URL, the disputed sentence and a source or observation that helps reproduce the issue to <a href="mailto:info@matthiasramahi.de?subject=Auspicious%20Music%20correction">info@matthiasramahi.de</a>. Material corrections are recorded on the affected page.</p>
